msgstr "Anwendungsmenü"

msgid "Arms"
msgstr "Zacken"

msgid "Arrow"
msgstr "Pfeil"

msgid "As many columns as fit in the width"
msgstr "So viele Spalten, wie in die Breite passen"

msgid "As the shape"
msgstr "Wie die Form"

msgid "As the system"
msgstr "Wie das System"

msgid "Asks GitHub; nothing about you is sent."
msgstr "Fragt GitHub; nichts über Sie wird gesendet."

